        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Represent status choices with domain values instead of string tokens. This constant's name identifies a status, state, phase, or outcome. Use a domain result, tagged union, Option, or Result so callers handle the choices explicitly. Ordinary text constants are outside this rule. Resolve the representation at its definition and callers; renaming the same token does not fix the model.",
